                "loc": "EXO.27.1+EXO.27.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 27.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 4.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sino nisio sipiimo sia alutare, khurumikhira sipiimo sisiene nisio barumikhira khupiima Lukaangu. Lukaangu lwoosi asi, lwaba ne lubachangu chisendimita kamakhumi karaano khucha asi ne chisendimita kamakhumi karaano bubalaayi alala ne sikiingi khu ndulo chisendimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano khucha angaaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubeka lwe asi bukali bwe alutare khukhwama khu musiingi yaba emita ndala khucha angaaki. Siseenge siloondakho siaba chisendimita kamakhumi karaano chimbeka choosi ne chimita chibili khucha angaaki. Siseenge siloondakho siosi siaba busa nga sitaayi chisendimita kamakhumi karaano buli lubeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubeka lwe angaaki luno, niio biianwa bioselwangwa, lwosi lwaba chimita chibili khucha angaaki. Chinjika choosi chine che mu koona chaba khukhila chimbeka chichiindi choosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khungaaki khwa alutare, khwaba khwatekanilila busa chimbeka choosi, chimita sita buli lubeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akari osi aba atekanilila busa chimbeka choosi, chimita saba buli lubeka ne lunika chisendimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano khucha mu ngaaki. Lubachangu lulabaao, chisendimita kamakhumi karaano bubalaayi. Engila eecha khu alutare yabaao; bikele biayo bie khuniinilakho bialola lubeka lwe ebukwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
