            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.35+EXO.29.36+EXO.29.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 29.35-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwami WELE omunyali owa bioosi amboolela ali, “Mwana wo mundu, kano niko kamalaka ka alutare. Khu ndaalo niyo bakhombakhile alutare eye khuaana biianwa bie khukhwosieliakho ne khuchukhakho kamalasile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaayi be kholo eya Satoki nibo bong'ene babenyekha beeche khusaaya ebweeni wase. Ese Omwami WELE ndoma ndi mukhabaelesie euunwa endoro eaanwe nga embosio eye khurusiao bubwoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulabukula kamalasile kayo matiiti kari mala mukare khu njika chine cha alutare, ne mu koona akari ne khu lukina. Mu ngila yino, mukhakwalaasie alutare ne khukitakaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi mukhabukule euunwa eye mbosio eye khurusiao bubwoni mala mwosiele abuundu niio muroboore embi ne Lukaangu enje we abuundu atakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo eye khabili, mukhaane endurume ekhalikho buubi bwosi bwosi tawe khuuba siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni. Alutare ekhatakaaswe nga yatakaaswa ne uunwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mwamalile khukhola murio mulabukula euunwa ekhalikho ne buubi bwosi bwosi tawe, muaane nga siianwa nende limiiku khukhwama mwituuli likhalikho buubi bwosi bwosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulabira ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, mala basaayi balara chumbe khu nyama echo mala bosie nga siianwa sie khukhwosia khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo saba mulaana embusi buli ndaalo khulwe siianwa sie khurusia bubwoni; lundi euunwa ne limiiku biikhalikho buubi bwosi bwosi tawe bilaanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo saba mulaana siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni khu alutare ne khukitakaasa; khwako mulakira alubeka khu Mwami Wele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Ne mumalile chindaalo chino, nio khukhwama endaalo eya munaane khuchiililila, basaayi bakhaane khu alutare biianwa bie khukhwosia nende bie kumuleembe, ne Ese ndamufukiilila enywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
